  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>歡迎來到櫻花（Sakura），這是一款融合竹子、WA 和楓樹的模組。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/XmQ8N1SBjJKhFy6.png\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">這個模組充滿了日式風格，包含定食、壽司以及大量食物。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">使用你的武士刀和肋差體驗全新的戰鬥風格，並在營火與炊具旁進行烹飪。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新的敵對生物手持武士刀，出現在竹林和楓林中！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新增服裝：和服、浴衣和外褂（Haori）。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">盡情享受吧~</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>官方宣傳片：</strong></h4>\n<p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eaTCFOl_YyQ?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">截圖：</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/aoQGLIkAwTb5z9s.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1519\" height=\"792\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/g8k9wzsUV7ZBpAn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1114\" height=\"580\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/7N4ioG1OHFQwtb2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/07/25/i8OR6hEB2IXyDHA.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Syameimaru 的 Patreon 連結：<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/syameimaru_zheng</a></p>",
